    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate is not a VERIFIED FACT",
      "prov:value": "Measured 2026-09-22 on the work-plan consolidation's own first commit\n(issue #956).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#956",
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate is not a VERIFIED FACT",
      "prov:value": "A session wrote three delegated claims, each citing bean `k59d` —\n*milestone critical paths go stale here* — and each instructing its reader to\n**re-verify the path before acting on it**.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean k59d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate is not a VERIFIED FACT",
      "prov:value": "It then copied `p5wm`'s critical\npath into one of them verbatim, through four `completed` beans."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate is not a VERIFIED FACT",
      "prov:value": "A rule that lives only in prose has a compliance ceiling nobody measures.**\nKnowing about `k59d` — citing it, quoting it, instructing three other agents\nabout it — did not prevent reproducing `k59d` in the same commit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate is not a VERIFIED FACT",
      "prov:value": "This is\n`1xhc`'s *\"a gate that does not fire is indistinguishable from one that passed\"*,\nand it is the same shape as `check:ci-health` reporting eight workflows green\nbeside **31 further workflow files that produced no run at all** — which it\nlabels *unjudged, not green*."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "pr",
      "cat-harness:section": "Running \"the gates that relate to my change\" is not running the gates",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-09-20, PR #526.** A change added two collectors to\n`kg-export.ts`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#526",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "And the follow-up push failed too, for the adjacent reason",
      "prov:value": "The fix for the above ran `gates --all` and reported **60 of 60**."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "And the follow-up push failed too, for the adjacent reason",
      "prov:value": "A third instance,\n2026-09-20: a splice script corrupted `<name>.json` while a run was in\nflight, and **40 of 61 gates failed reading a file that was invalid for about\na minute**.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "And the follow-up push failed too, for the adjacent reason",
      "prov:value": "The `kg-qa` row is a derived QA result: its record is the commit-keyed entry\nthe CI job `qa-publish` stores on the orphan `qa-reports` branch (arc `3fva`),\nand the committed copy goes when bean `5hox` removes it.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 5hox",
        "bean 3fva"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-14",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "And the follow-up push failed too, for the adjacent reason",
      "prov:value": "**This paragraph said \"at least two files\" and was wrong on its first\ncommit** — it named the sidecar and missed the generated docs, and\n`gen-skill-docs --check` duly failed, 1 of 60."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What a `*:check` failure is telling you",
      "prov:value": "**QA gates are moving to a different shape, and their failure means something\nelse.** Arc `3fva` takes derived QA results off `main`, so a gate over the\n`qa` graph cannot compare against a committed file for long."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate set is not a CLEAN RUN",
      "prov:value": "Bean `3ozg` is its worked\nexample — an `engine_version` counted as substantive rewrote 72 committed sidecars\non every branch — and the skill also carries why discarding such a churn is a\nworkaround whose habit is the defect.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 3ozg"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-17",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "If `bun run cat gates` reports no gates",
      "prov:value": "An empty sweep\nthat exits 0 is indistinguishable from a passing one — the defect this\nrepository has paid for three separate times: a `grep` over zero Lean files\nprinting OK, a `ruff` scan of missing paths reporting a clean baseline it had\nnever computed, and `readme:sync:check` passing over a README with no markers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/process/process-core/platform-gates.md#provenance-18",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "...and a green gate is not a VERIFIED FACT",
      "prov:value": "| claim | carried the stale content | `check:stale-paths` |\n|---|---|---|\n| `10uc` | yes, as a numbered path | **✗ failed the push** |\n| `w0cr` | yes, as prose | **✓ passed** |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean w0cr"
      ]
    }
